enter use • ^t test results • ^b use fastest • ^n add • esc clear/quit • F1 help
==== F1 ====
Sneakernet - help   any key closes this

Move                                  List and screens
  ↑            up                       ^n / F2      add
  ↓            down                     ^x / F8      remove
  pgup         page up                  ^l / F3      logs
  pgdn         page down              
  esc          clear/quit             Service and app
                                        ^r           restart
Servers                                 ^s           start/stop
  enter        use                      F1 / ^g      help
  ^t / F5      test results             ^c / F10     quit
  ^b / F6      use fastest            
  ^a / F7      auto                   
  ^o           sort                   

Search
  Type to filter by name, then by type, host, SNI... Or limit it to one
  property: proto: net: sec: host: port: sni: path: flow: fp: e.g. sec:reality
  port:443. Paste share links anywhere to add them.
Without the TUI
  Every action is also a command (handy with a screen reader): sneakernet list |
  switch <n|auto> | test --all | add | remove <n> | status